          "n": "0",
          "text": "Boy, maybe if you cared enough (Maybe if you cared enough)",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "I wouldn't have to care so much (Wouldn't have to care so much)",
